      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. Proteins"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lrjd0eg",
      "content": "Proteins are body-building nutrients composed of amino acids. They help in growth, repair and enzyme formation."
    },
    {
      "id": "shc4rry",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
