      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nlp9xc6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. Vitamins & Minerals"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wih1tws",
      "content": "Vitamins and minerals regulate body processes such as immunity, bone formation and blood production."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "A balanced diet provides all essential nutrients in proper proportions along with adequate roughage and water.",
      "id": "23cdq5l"
    },
    {
      "id": "emdogdt",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Balanced Diet"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4fdlowp",
      "content": "A balanced diet contains adequate amounts of carbohydrates, proteins, fats, vitamins, minerals, water and roughage in proper proportion. "
    },
    {
      "id": "ljak8t3",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Component</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Percentage of Energy</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Example</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Carbohydrates</p>",
            "<p>50-60%</p>",
            "<p>Rice</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Proteins</p>",
            "<p>10-15%</p>",
            "<p>Pulses</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Fats</p>",
            "<p>20-30%</p>",
            "<p>Oil</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "z186o67",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Malnutrition"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "untjtxt",
      "content": "Malnutrition occurs when the body does not get adequate nutrients."
    },
    {
      "id": "yh4qrj3",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
